<odoo>

<!--
    "Ils nous font confiance": the real Google reviews of the TECAS listing,
    with a badge linking back to the listing itself.

    THE REVIEWS ARE REAL AND MUST STAY REAL. They are copied from the public
    Google Maps page of Tecas Energie Solaire (place id 0xda7cbf0955299c5,
    Casablanca), not written for the site. Two consequences:

    * The wording here is a faithful French rendering of reviews Google served
      translated into English; each original was written in French ("Voir
      l'original (français)" on the listing). Anyone editing this block should
      check a quote against its original before changing it, and never
      "improve" it — these are quotes from named people.
    * Only the reviewer's first name is shown, which is what the client asked
      for. No city is claimed: Google publishes none for these reviewers, and
      inventing one would attribute a made-up detail to a real person. Add the
      city to an author line only once someone actually knows it.

    Google's own listing carries the star ratings and the review count, so the
    block deliberately shows neither an average nor a total it would have to
    keep in step by hand — the badge sends visitors to the source instead.

    Plain html on purpose (no QWeb): this block is dropped into a page, and a
    t-* attribute anywhere under #wrap costs the page its editor drop zones.
    See the comment in s_tecas_categories.xml.
-->
<template id="s_tecas_reviews" name="Avis clients">
    <section class="s_tecas_reviews pt64 pb64">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="s_tecas_lead_title text-center">Ils nous font confiance</h2>

            <div class="s_tecas_reviews_badge">
                <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Tecas+Energie+Solaire/@33.6365707,-7.5009827,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0xda7cbf0955299c5:0x52157001a0cadb0c!8m2!3d33.6365707!4d-7.5009827!16s%2Fg%2F11fhvkhzhg"
                   class="s_tecas_reviews_gbtn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                    <span class="s_tecas_reviews_glogo">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Google">
                            <path fill="#EA4335" d="M24 9.5c3.54 0 6.71 1.22 9.21 3.6l6.85-6.85C35.9 2.38 30.47 0 24 0 14.62 0 6.51 5.38 2.56 13.22l7.98 6.19C12.43 13.72 17.74 9.5 24 9.5z"/>
                            <path fill="#4285F4" d="M46.98 24.55c0-1.57-.15-3.09-.38-4.55H24v9.02h12.94c-.58 2.96-2.26 5.48-4.78 7.18l7.73 6c4.51-4.18 7.09-10.36 7.09-17.65z"/>
                            <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M10.53 28.59c-.48-1.45-.76-2.99-.76-4.59s.27-3.14.76-4.59l-7.98-6.19C.92 16.46 0 20.12 0 24c0 3.88.92 7.54 2.56 10.78l7.97-6.19z"/>
                            <path fill="#34A853" d="M24 48c6.48 0 11.93-2.13 15.89-5.81l-7.73-6c-2.15 1.45-4.92 2.3-8.16 2.3-6.26 0-11.57-4.22-13.47-9.91l-7.98 6.19C6.51 42.62 14.62 48 24 48z"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <span class="s_tecas_reviews_gtext">
                        <span class="s_tecas_reviews_gtitle">Avis Google</span>
                        <span class="s_tecas_reviews_gsub">Tecas Energie Solaire, Casablanca</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="s_tecas_reviews_gcta">Voir sur Google Maps</span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4">

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="s_tecas_review_card">
                        <div class="s_tecas_review_stars" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
                            <i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/>
                        </div>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_text">
                            “Salam, j'ai échangé au téléphone avec Soukaina, de l'équipe
                            commerciale. Elle m'a aidé à choisir le bon produit, à un prix très
                            compétitif. Je salue sa patience et son professionnalisme, et je
                            recommande cette société aux autres clients.”
                        </p>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_author">— Mohamed, avis Google</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="s_tecas_review_card">
                        <div class="s_tecas_review_stars" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
                            <i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/>
                        </div>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_text">
                            “Bon service, équipe professionnelle.”
                        </p>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_author">— Souad, avis Google</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="s_tecas_review_card">
                        <div class="s_tecas_review_stars" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
                            <i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/>
                        </div>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_text">
                            “Excellent service, équipe performante.”
                        </p>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_author">— Othmane, avis Google</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="s_tecas_review_card">
                        <div class="s_tecas_review_stars" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
                            <i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/>
                        </div>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_text">
                            “Bon rapport qualité-prix, des gens sérieux, je les recommande.”
                        </p>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_author">— Youness, avis Google</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="s_tecas_review_card">
                        <div class="s_tecas_review_stars" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
                            <i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/>
                        </div>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_text">
                            “Très bons services.”
                        </p>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_author">— Badr, avis Google</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="s_tecas_review_card">
                        <div class="s_tecas_review_stars" aria-label="5 étoiles sur 5">
                            <i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/><i class="fa fa-star"/>
                        </div>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_text">
                            “Installation et mise en service parfaites, une équipe de
                            professionnels.”
                        </p>
                        <p class="s_tecas_review_author">— Youssef, avis Google</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</template>

</odoo>
